<li>Execute atomic online hot backups using SQLite native VACUUM INTO command without stalling web traffic.</li>
<li>Schedule periodic background passive checkpoints (PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(PASSIVE)) to manage WAL file size.</li>
<li>Compress and encrypt backup database artifacts before streaming them to geographically distributed object stores.</li>
<li>Integrate streaming WAL replication tools like Litestream for sub-second Recovery Point Objectives (RPO).</li>
<li>Run automated PRAGMA integrity_check validations against restored backup files in isolated CI environments.</li>
<li>Maintain at least thirty days of point-in-time recovery archives alongside weekly cold defragmented snapshots.</li>
</ul>
