<p>Laravel and Inertia provide first-class testing utilities that permit testing frontend page responses directly from PHP without booting a real web browser. Using the assertInertia method in Pest or PHPUnit, you can verify that a controller returns the correct Vue component, contains expected props, and enforces authorization rules.</p>
