<li>Configure global HTTP interceptors to gracefully handle 419 session expirations and network timeouts.</li>
<li>Apply leading-edge debouncing to prevent rapid-click race conditions and redundant database write requests.</li>
<li>Provide subtle, accessible toast notifications whenever a background synchronization rollback occurs.</li>
