<ul>
<li>Decouple infrastructure costs from user growth by embracing consolidated, single-server deployment architectures.</li>
<li>Maintain gross operating margins above eighty-five percent to build an invincible financial moat against market downturns.</li>
<li>Prioritize 100% equity ownership and personal autonomy over speculative venture capital valuations.</li>
<li>Design self-serve onboarding flows that deliver initial core product value within the first three minutes of signup.</li>
<li>Write exhaustive, empathetic documentation to minimize incoming customer support tickets to near zero.</li>
<li>Celebrate the dignity of building a quiet, sustainable, and highly profitable software business that stands the test of time.</li>
</ul>
