<p>This photon stimulation increases adenosine triphosphate (ATP) synthesis, reduces reactive oxygen species (ROS), and enhances cellular repair mechanisms throughout the body. Conversely, prolonged exposure to narrow-spectrum indoor artificial lighting lacking near-infrared components starves tissues of these vital restorative wavelengths.</p>
