<p>This glymphatic cleansing mechanism is the brain's primary defense against cognitive decline and neurological fatigue. When sleep is shortened or fragmented by late-night screen exposure, metabolic waste accumulates, leaving you waking up feeling exhausted and mentally sluggish.</p>
<p>Treating sleep as a sacred, non-negotiable biological discipline is not an indulgence; it is the fundamental prerequisite for sharp intellect, emotional resilience, and lifelong cognitive health.</p>
